}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-08-14T20:19:18Z","updated_at":"2020-08-14T20:19:18Z","body":"Yeah this certainly sounds like a bug. Individual entity visibility shouldn't determine whether or not we clear the framebuffer. A minimal example that reproduces the error would be helpful here.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/674255618/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"cart","id":2694663,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTQ2NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2694663?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart","html_url":"https://github.com/cart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/674337553","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/187#issuecomment-674337553","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/187","id":674337553,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY3NDMzNzU1Mw==","user":{"login":"jayong93","id":14884849,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODg0ODQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14884849?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93","html_url":"https://github.com/jayong93","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-08-15T02:46:23Z","updated_at":"2020-08-15T02:50:26Z","body":"@cart \r\nI added some code to the bevy's breakout example to reproduce the bug:\r\nhttps://gist.github.com/jayong93/6d2082442c8f7cfe5a4c89b532f98940\r\n\r\nWhat I did is adding this system to `breakout.rs` to hide a ball on mouse click:\r\n(Nevermind about the function name. It's from my prototype game 😄)\r\n```rust\r\nfn speed_circle_place_system(\r\n    mut input_reader: ResMut<EventReader<MouseButtonInput>>,\r\n    button_input: Res<Events<MouseButtonInput>>,\r\n    mut query: Query<(&Ball, &mut Draw)>,\r\n) {\r\n    match input_reader.latest(&button_input) {\r\n        Some(MouseButtonInput {\r\n            button: MouseButton::Left,\r\n            state: ElementState::Pressed,\r\n        }) => {\r\n            for (_, mut draw) in &mut query.iter() {\r\n                draw.is_visible = !draw.is_visible;\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        _ => {}\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n```\r\nIf you click left mouse button, the ball would disappear. But also the paddle would stop moving even if you move it by pressing left/right arrow key.\r\n\r\nI checked this bug on Windows 10 + rust 1.45.2 and I'm not sure that it is reproducible on other OSs.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/674337553/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jayong93","id":14884849,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0ODg0ODQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14884849?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93","html_url":"https://github.com/jayong93","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jayong93/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":3658157074,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MzY1ODE1NzA3NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/events/3658157074","actor":{"login":"cart","id":2694663,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTQ2NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2694663?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart","html_url":"https://github.com/cart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/followers","following_url":"https://api